      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} - we had a brief aside at the top of the year, and I brought this to Strasz as well two months ago. Multiple leaders in our private collaborative would also like to see this. In order to push priority, what helps best? Voting on a canny?\n\nAs an organization, we can also share our current budget and how it's been limited by these features and how we would be able to spend (more) more efficiently in the future.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
