  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-13T00:30:06.777Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Currently with gifting it's my understanding you can do the following:\n\n> Drop a box and the closest in proximity to box opening receive the gift\n\n> Be able to truly randomly gift VRC+ throughout the entire instance\n\n>> What I would request, is that there's one additional checkbox asking: \"would you like to prioritize those without VRC+?\"\n\n>>> This allows the giftER to know that the giftED is truly receiving VRC + and not an extra month.\n\n2. When purchasing 10, 20, 40 + VRC+s, I would love the ability to give as many as I want at the time and *not just* the amount I just ordered. Ex: I ordered 40 because it's convenient to buy at once, but I want to give 20 one Friday and 20 another Friday. Or (even worse), I buy 40 because there *were* 40 people in an instance > I go to gift > now there are 30 people! 10 people get the gift x2 (very unintentionally). \n\nNot attempting to be stingy, but trying to spread the love to as many people as possible! Help me spend more money, VRChat!",
